  "version": "0.17.0-alpha.4",
  "notes": "> **⚠️ Important notice for users on 0.14.0-alpha.9 – 0.14.0**: these versions have a bug that prevents automatic updates from completing. Please open `https://uniclipboard.app/download` in your browser, download the latest installer, and reinstall manually.\n\n## 0.17.0-alpha.4 - 2026-06-24\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Make the tray \"Restart\" option also restart the background service, not just the main window (#1157)\n- Make the \"Open File Location\" action on received files reveal the file in the system file manager (#1158)\n- Stop received clipboard items from being sent back to the original device when multiple items arrive in quick succession (#1146)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n> **⚠️ 重要公告（0.14.0-alpha.9 ~ 0.14.0 用户）**：这些版本存在自动更新缺陷，点击安装后无法完成更新。请在浏览器中打开 `https://uniclipboard.app/download`，手动下载最新安装包覆盖安装。\n\n## 0.17.0-alpha.4 - 2026-06-24\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复托盘「重启」菜单项，现在会同时重启后台服务，而不仅重启主窗口 (#1157)\n- 修复收到的文件「打开文件位置」操作，现在能在系统文件管理器中正确定位该文件 (#1158)\n- 修复连续接收多项剪贴板内容时可能将其回传给发送方的问题 (#1146)",
